# Live UI preview

UI that is not on `main` still needs a live clickable preview before review or merge. Screenshots are not enough.

- Run the real Next server of that working tree (`npm run dev`, port 43181).
- Post the exact URL at the top of the PR description and in a PR comment. Cursor preview tunnel, cloudflared quick tunnel, or similar.
- The human walks `/` and the five desks: `/ops/wellness`, `/ops/diagnostic`, `/ops/unnaturalfertility`, `/ops/cosmetic`, `/ops/stimulants`.
- Do not invent a production host. This hub has none yet.
- Do not merge. Do not deploy until Devo says merge and deploy.
